To SELBK
Fm ASI

Hi Ms Kim,

Sorry for belated reply.

I think we need Hankook continous support for M.East.
But for after BKG request, usually POD office have authority
to give free time discount.

To WOG

Please kindly comment.

Thank you.

b.rgds/Paris

From: So-Youn Kim
Sent: Friday, November 15, 2013 5:13 PM
To: So-Youn Kim; Paris PENG; Jeong-Jae CHOI
Cc: Jung-Seo MOON; Sang-Jin HAN; Dong-Seok LEE; Jessie(Ji-Soo) YOON
Subject: RE: HANKOOK TIRE IRAN DEM/DET DISCOUNT REQUEST

ATTACHING THE DETAILED OVER-FREETIME INFO

15 NOV 13

TO : ASI
CC : CCE, WOG, ASM
FM : SELBK

Re : HANKOOK TIRE IRAN DEM/DET DISCOUNT REQUEST

Dear ASI, good day to you.

We request you to review the below Hankook Tire's request and give us your opinion.
They requested us to extend the freetime for IRBUZ cargo which already arrived, released and returned.

= Details =

l  Shipper : Hankook Tire

l  Volume : 165 FEU

l  Over 30 days : 150 FEU (For DET)

l  VVD : HJBP0040W (ETD 2013/06/06 KRPUS)

l  ETA AT IRBUZ : 2013/08/05
- History : It had initially been shipped for IRKHO. However, Iran Sanction suddenly got strengthened and
  the shipmen stayed at AEJEA for about a month.
  Hankook Tire and we tried very hard to prepare any documents to prove this shipment is safe,
  we succeeded in sending this cargo to IRBUZ. Since it is a big shipment,
  165 FEU, it was hard to find the cargo and return it within freetime (30 days).

l  Remark
- AEJEA or Iran cargo promotion
  : Hankook tire suggested AEJEA or Iran cargo support if we provide them 40 days of freetime.
   They confirmed AEJEA cargo 40~70FEU/Month, and its final dest is IRBUZ.
    We are trying to make them to ship this cargo for IRBUZ, and they are reviewing internally.
   As you know, IRBUZ cargo is the most expensive cargo now.
 In this regard, please give us your opinoin on the below two options.

- How many additional free days can we get if Hankook tire support 40~70FEU of AEJEA Cargo?
- How many additional free days can we get if Hankook tire support 40~70FEU of IRBUZ Cargo?

We hope you support us with the freetime to have more IRBUZ cargo for the company at this time being.

Thank you.


B. RGDS
SOYEON, KIM/MGR
Core Customer Sales Team

